% The melody library: 100 whole public-domain melodies, easiest first (docs/melody-library-100.md).
% Build with `npm run library` (scripts/build-library.ts writes library.ts next to this file).
%
% Per tune: %%id (stable, hyphen-free), %%level (1-9), %%source (where the notes come from), %%tempo
% (where its Q: comes from: the composer's marking, the source MIDI or the usual performance), and the
% usual T:, M:, L:, Q: (the tune's own tempo) and K: fields. Write repeats out in full, no rests (fold a
% rest into the note before it), modes as their major/minor key signature (D dorian = K:C).
% Rights: a composed tune qualifies when its composer died in 1955 or earlier and it was published in
% 1930 or earlier; folk tunes carry no composer. The melody only, never a modern arrangement of it.

% ═══ Level 1 ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

